  "title": "Court Carnival — Legends of the Boardwalk Story Map",
  "description": "Expanded Venice Beach world map for FEL story mode. 5 streaming zones derived from court_carnival_environment_layout v1.0, expanded vertically (rooftop row) and horizontally (beach access). 20 board spaces arranged in a loop. Design reference: KH1 world traversal + SA2 rail grinding + PSP portal streaming.",
  "version": "1.0",
  "base_layout": "infra/fel_environment_layouts/court_carnival_environment_layout.md",
